  "instructions": [
    "preheat the oven to 375°f (190°c).",
    "season the lamb with tandoori spice blend and let it sit at room temperature for 30 minutes.",
    "in a large saucepan, melt 2 tablespoons of butter over medium heat. add the onion, carrot, and apple.",
    "cook until the vegetables are tender, stirring occasionally, about 20 minutes.",
    "add the grapefruit juice, flour, and mustard to the saucepan. stir to combine.",
    "add the lamb to the saucepan and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "transfer the lamb and vegetables to a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
    "dot the top of the lamb with the remaining 4 tablespoons of butter.",
    "sprinkle the parmesan cheese over the lamb.",
    "cover the dish with aluminum foil and bake for 1 1/2 hours.",
    "remove the foil and continue baking until the top is golden brown, about 15-20 minutes.",
    "let the gratin rest for 10-15 minutes before serving."
  ],
